1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,782
Spring, 1220.

2
00:00:03,002 --> 00:00:05,453
Samarkand, the richest city on the Silk

3
00:00:05,453 --> 00:00:05,818
Road.

4
00:00:06,038 --> 00:00:07,361
Eight iron gates.

5
00:00:07,581 --> 00:00:09,783
Tens of thousands of soldiers on the

6
00:00:09,783 --> 00:00:10,183
walls.

7
00:00:10,653 --> 00:00:12,445
Then an army appears outside.

8
00:00:12,665 --> 00:00:14,645
It looks twice as big as anyone

9
00:00:14,645 --> 00:00:15,204
expected.

10
00:00:15,674 --> 00:00:17,146
But half of it is fake.

11
00:00:17,366 --> 00:00:19,873
Genghis Khan has put his prisoners from

12
00:00:19,873 --> 00:00:22,006
Bukhara in front, holding banners,

13
00:00:22,006 --> 00:00:23,446
to look like soldiers.

14
00:00:23,916 --> 00:00:26,115
They are also sent first against the

15
00:00:26,115 --> 00:00:27,564
walls, as human shields.

16
00:00:27,784 --> 00:00:29,280
Many of them die there,

17
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,240
