18
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:34,355
The defenders charge out with war elephants.

19
00:00:34,575 --> 00:00:36,218
The Mongols pretend to run,

20
00:00:36,218 --> 00:00:37,711
then turn and trap them.

21
00:00:38,181 --> 00:00:39,973
Within days the city gives up.

22
00:00:40,193 --> 00:00:42,318
Only two thousand men hold out in

23
00:00:42,318 --> 00:00:43,095
the citadel.

24
00:00:43,565 --> 00:00:45,058
Would you have opened the gates?

25
00:00:45,278 --> 00:00:47,497
Comment below, and follow for more.

26
00:00:47,717 --> 00:00:49,794
The full story of Samarkand is on

27
00:00:49,794 --> 00:00:50,554
